what I was replying to.  Suppose then that another member of the
newsgroup pointed it out and implied that I was being rude by ignoring
netiquette.

If I were truly ignorant of the inconvenience imposed on other readers
by top-posting, would it be reasonable for me to go off on a rampage
denouncing the rudeness shown to me in that reply, and inviting more
rudeness with rudeness of my own?  And if I were not ignorant of the
facts, would it still be reasonable for me to embark on an escalation of
hostilities?

