online activity are willing, on most levels, to cooperate.  Was there
unnecessary rudeness in pointing out the OP's faux pas?  Perhaps.  But
the OP is being disingenuous in calling others hypocritical while doing
everything possible to provoke more flames.  This is a far more serious
